WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.901
-Frank Sheeran.
I'm saying that right?

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.336
-Yeah, you said it right.

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:07.173
-Uh, under the contract,
management can only

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.275
fly or drive around
very specific charges.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.445
So, you every show up late?

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:15.615
-No.
-You have any moving violations?

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.418
-No.
-Do you drink on the job?

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.352
-No.
-You ever hit anybody?

00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:23.322
-On the job?
-Yeah.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:24.757
-I don't think so.
-Alright, then.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.226
We don't have nothing
to worry about.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.197
-I want you to meet my cousin,
Russell Bufalino.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:33.332
-How are you?
-Hey. Nice to meet you.

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:34.700
-It was like the army.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.737
You followed orders,
you did the right thing.

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:42.609
You got rewarded.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:43.776
-[ Screams ]

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:45.678
-A friend of ours is having
a little trouble,

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.080
a friend at the top.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.650
-Back then, there was nobody
in this country

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.585
who didn't know
who Jimmy Hoffa was.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.553
-He's got a gun!

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.022
-Get that gun out of his hand!

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.792
-You always charge
a guy with a gun.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.025
With a knife, you run away.

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:02.327
So you charge with a gun.

00:01:02.327 --> 00:01:05.298
With a knife, you run.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.367
Hiya, Frank. Would you like
to be a part of history?

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.669
-Yes, I would.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:12.304
-Big business and the government
are working together

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:13.706
trying to pull us apart.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.242
-Something's got to be done.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.444
-What else he say?

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:22.315
Now's not the time to not say.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:25.819
-We're going to war
with these people.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.386
-War.

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:30.523
-Things have gotten out of hand
with our friend.

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:33.292
-You got to sit down.
Everybody says so.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:36.596
-No, I'm not sitting down.
I can't do it.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.597
-It's what it is.
-What it is.

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:39.632
-I knew things.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.167
They don't know what I know.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:49.641
♪♪

00:01:49.641 --> 00:01:51.143
-It's going to happen.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.546
-Either way, he's going.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:59.252
♪♪

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.122
-You know, I don't, uh, I don't
care whether you did it or not.

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:04.390
That makes no difference to me.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.358
-Yeah, I know.
-I'm here to defend you.

00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:08.027
Right?
-Right.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.433
What do you want to know? You
want to know if I did it or not?

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:16.202
-No.
-[ Chuckles ]

